{
    "title": "JustAnswer: Ask for help, 24/7",
    "description": "Get an expert answer to every question\u2014right on your phone with the JustAnswer app. Chat with 12,000+ verified Experts on demand, 24/7. Since 2003, we've helped more than 10 million people get instant access to professional help.\u202f \u202f \r\n\r\nAPP FEATURES \r\n\r\n- Ask questions in 700+ professional specialties including legal, medical, pet care & more. \r\n- Get 2 free phone calls to Experts a month\u2014a $50+ value! \r\n- Save your favorite Experts so you can ask questions again and again. \r\n- Get notified the instant an Expert replies to your question. \r\n\r\nRated 4.1/5 by customers on TrustPilot:\u202fhttps://www.trustpilot.com/review/www.justanswer.com\u202f \r\n\r\nHOW IT WORKS \r\n\r\nAsk as many questions as you want with a monthly membership:  \r\n\r\nStep 1\u2014Tell us your situation. Ask any question, 24/7. Chat with Experts like lawyers, doctors, veterinarians, mechanics, computer techs, electricians, plumbers, tax accountants, and more.  \r\n\r\nStep 2\u2014We\u2019ll connect you in minutes with the best Expert for your question. \r\n\r\nStep 3\u2014Talk, text, or chat till you have your answer. Members get unlimited conversations, 24/7, so you\u2019ll always have an Expert ready to help. \r\n\r\nASK TRUSTED PROFESSIONALS \r\n\r\nJustAnswer connects you with real Experts, so you can feel confident in the answers you get. Every Expert on JustAnswer is vetted through a Multi-Step Expert Quality Process, including license verification and peer reviews. \r\n\r\nExperts join JustAnswer from some of the world\u2019s most trusted institutions, including Harvard lawyers, UCLA doctors, Microsoft-certified computer techs, Christie\u2019s appraisers, UC Davis vets. \r\n\r\nCONVENIENT ONLINE HELP  \r\n\r\nDiscuss your individual situation with an Expert who specializes in your topic, 24/7. \r\n\r\nLAW: Lawyers specializing in immigration law, family law, employment law, real estate law, criminal law, landlord-tenant law, education law, IP law, estate law, personal injury law, traffic law, and more. \r\n\r\nHEALTH: Doctors and specialists for OB-GYN, dermatology, neurology, urology, pediatrics, dental health, eye health, cardiology, oncology, mental health counseling, and general wellness. \r\n\r\nPETS: Vet care for all pets, big or small, including dogs, cats, birds, reptiles, horses, rabbits, fish, rodents, exotic pets, and farm animals.  \r\n\r\nTECH: Support for computers, laptops, mobile phones, email, Microsoft Office, printers, WiFi networking, TVs, and consumer electronics. \r\n\r\nCARS: Most domestic and foreign car brands, motorcycles, trucks, RVs, heavy equipment, and even boats. \r\n\r\nHOME IMPROVEMENT: Appliance, heating, ventilation, air conditioning, plumbing, electrical, pool and spa, landscaping, home renovation, and general maintenance. \r\n\r\nAND MORE: Appraisals, small business help, tax advisory, relationship counseling, job counseling, firearms, and dream interpretation. \r\n\r\nCONTACT US\u202f \r\n\r\nIf for any reason you\u2019re not satisfied our Customer Care team is ready to help 24/7. Please contact us directly at AppSupport@justanswer.com or call 800-941-1229 so we can help resolve your concerns.  \r\n\r\nUse our live chat for an instant response:  \r\nhttps://www.justanswer.com/help/contact-us",
    "descriptionHTML": "Get an expert answer to every question\u2014right on your phone with the JustAnswer app. Chat with 12,000+ verified Experts on demand, 24/7. Since 2003, we&#39;ve helped more than 10 million people get instant access to professional help.\u202f \u202f <br><br>APP FEATURES <br><br>- Ask questions in 700+ professional specialties including legal, medical, pet care &amp; more. <br>- Get 2 free phone calls to Experts a month\u2014a $50+ value! <br>- Save your favorite Experts so you can ask questions again and again. <br>- Get notified the instant an Expert replies to your question. <br><br>Rated 4.1/5 by customers on TrustPilot:\u202fhttps://www.trustpilot.com/review/www.justanswer.com\u202f <br><br>HOW IT WORKS <br><br>Ask as many questions as you want with a monthly membership:  <br><br>Step 1\u2014Tell us your situation. Ask any question, 24/7. Chat with Experts like lawyers, doctors, veterinarians, mechanics, computer techs, electricians, plumbers, tax accountants, and more.  <br><br>Step 2\u2014We\u2019ll connect you in minutes with the best Expert for your question. <br><br>Step 3\u2014Talk, text, or chat till you have your answer. Members get unlimited conversations, 24/7, so you\u2019ll always have an Expert ready to help. <br><br>ASK TRUSTED PROFESSIONALS <br><br>JustAnswer connects you with real Experts, so you can feel confident in the answers you get. Every Expert on JustAnswer is vetted through a Multi-Step Expert Quality Process, including license verification and peer reviews. <br><br>Experts join JustAnswer from some of the world\u2019s most trusted institutions, including Harvard lawyers, UCLA doctors, Microsoft-certified computer techs, Christie\u2019s appraisers, UC Davis vets. <br><br>CONVENIENT ONLINE HELP  <br><br>Discuss your individual situation with an Expert who specializes in your topic, 24/7. <br><br>LAW: Lawyers specializing in immigration law, family law, employment law, real estate law, criminal law, landlord-tenant law, education law, IP law, estate law, personal injury law, traffic law, and more. <br><br>HEALTH: Doctors and specialists for OB-GYN, dermatology, neurology, urology, pediatrics, dental health, eye health, cardiology, oncology, mental health counseling, and general wellness. <br><br>PETS: Vet care for all pets, big or small, including dogs, cats, birds, reptiles, horses, rabbits, fish, rodents, exotic pets, and farm animals.  <br><br>TECH: Support for computers, laptops, mobile phones, email, Microsoft Office, printers, WiFi networking, TVs, and consumer electronics. <br><br>CARS: Most domestic and foreign car brands, motorcycles, trucks, RVs, heavy equipment, and even boats. <br><br>HOME IMPROVEMENT: Appliance, heating, ventilation, air conditioning, plumbing, electrical, pool and spa, landscaping, home renovation, and general maintenance. <br><br>AND MORE: Appraisals, small business help, tax advisory, relationship counseling, job counseling, firearms, and dream interpretation. <br><br>CONTACT US\u202f <br><br>If for any reason you\u2019re not satisfied our Customer Care team is ready to help 24/7. Please contact us directly at AppSupport@justanswer.com or call 800-941-1229 so we can help resolve your concerns.  <br><br>Use our live chat for an instant response:  <br>https://www.justanswer.com/help/contact-us",
